#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:10
msgid "Explicit-state numeric algorithms"
msgstr "显式状态的数值算法"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:12
msgid ""
"Select `Nexus::Algorithms` for the portable C11 scalar profile. The caller "
"provides every mutable history, coefficient array and workspace, and "
"serializes updates with reset and teardown. Algorithms perform no device "
"I/O, clock read, allocation or scheduling. The [leaf "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/algorithms/README.md) owns the selected conventions; "
"public declarations below own each operation."
msgstr ""
"选择 `Nexus::Algorithms` 使用可移植 C11 scalar profile。调用者提供全部可变历史、系数数组和 "
"workspace，并将更新与 reset／teardown 串行化。算法不访问器件、不读 "
"clock、不分配或调度。选定约定由[叶合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/algorithms/README.md)维护；每个操作的合同由下方公共声明维护。"

