"Task/IRQ pure arithmetic; no retained storage or allocation. Rounding is "
"nearest with ties away from zero."
msgstr "Task／IRQ 纯算术；不保留存储引用，也不分配。舍入到最近值，恰好位于中点时向远离零的方向舍入。"

